# The actual weekly deliverables live in OneDrive (synced via the CGMlabreport
# junction) and are never tracked here. This repo only holds the instructions,
# templates, and lightweight markdown drafts needed to reproduce the workflow.
/CGMlabreport/

# Pre-existing local tooling/scaffolding unrelated to this workflow (bundled
# skill plugins with their own node_modules/__pycache__/logs, a separate
# generic agent framework). Not "our instruction/setting" for this project
# and far too large to version here.
/.claude/
/.github/

# Downloaded source papers and extracted text dumps are large and easy to
# re-fetch, don't belong in git history.
*.pdf
*.txt

# Word documents are generally excluded (final reports live in OneDrive), with
# one deliberate exception below: the pandoc reference-doc that defines the
# house style. It's small (~12KB) and required for a fresh session to
# reproduce identical formatting, without it pandoc falls back to its own
# default styling and the 2-page-limit tuning done here is lost.
*.docx
*.doc
!_workdir/_template/reference.docx

# Misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
